STYLE GLOBAL RENDERING RULE — FROST

All panels, characters, objects, clothing, environments, and visual elements must follow the FROST rendering style as the highest-priority visual rule.

FROST is a premium Korean webtoon illustration style characterized by beautiful mature characters, delicate hand-drawn linework, cool muted color harmony, very pale desaturated ivory skin, richly abundant flowing hair, and selective high-detail rendering.

The character should be beautiful, elegant, mature, cool, slightly distant, sophisticated, and emotionally restrained.

The character receives substantially more detail than the background.

The image should feel like a refined Korean webtoon illustration, never like photorealistic artwork, 3D rendering, a generic anime image, or a simplified character design sheet.


